{"id":"n15017-2-2","stage":4,"title":"가히 · 果然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15017-2-2-1","ko":"오늘 회식에서 술은 안 마시나요?","zh":"今天聚餐的时候你不喝酒吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"회식에서","meaning":"聚餐，会餐，饭局","explanation":"회식：聚餐，会餐，饭局；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"회식","audio":"/audio/b508d0255be0121e8575.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88144","senseId":"1","lemma":"회식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회식에서","audio":"/audio/b132edc7248bac2f8ee6.mp3"}},{"text":"술은","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술은","audio":"/audio/7918286aa052e0618acc.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"마시나요?","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시나요","audio":"/audio/d895154fddfe9c4d3a23.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b508d0255be0121e","term":"회식","zh":"聚餐，会餐，饭局","audio":"/audio/b508d0255be0121e8575.mp3","entryId":"88144","definition":"同属于某组织或团体的人聚在一起吃饭；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː식","훼ː식"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2f35dfeabe9394bb6fb6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15017-2-2-2","ko":"이렇게 좋은 날 가히 술이 빠질 수 있겠습니까?","zh":"这么好的日子，怎么可能不喝酒呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，吉","explanation":"좋다：好，吉；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"9","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"날","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}},{"text":"가히","meaning":"果然，决","explanation":"가히：果然，决。","readings":[{"term":"가히","audio":"/audio/87493c9205963c2450c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15017","senseId":"2","lemma":"가히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가히","audio":"/audio/87493c9205963c2450c1.mp3"}},{"text":"술이","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술이","audio":"/audio/85bd8ad79fb44e88874e.mp3"}},{"text":"빠질","meaning":"缺席，不参加，退出，脱离","explanation":"빠지다：缺席，不参加，退出，脱离；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"8","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠질","audio":"/audio/68d1987aa797db0a70d4.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠습니까?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠습니까","audio":"/audio/4c7f96c94d927d361258.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，吉","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"日子或机会等正合适。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"87493c9205963c24","term":"가히","zh":"果然，决","audio":"/audio/87493c9205963c2450c1.mp3","entryId":"15017","definition":"的确真的；或指无论什么情况都绝对地。","pronunciation":["가ː히"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"缺席，不参加，退出，脱离","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"不参与某事或某个聚会，或中间退场。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a687215fac9ec932a97b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.985,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15017","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.7103,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这么好的日子，怎么可能不喝酒呢？","今天聚餐的时候你不喝酒吗？","这次旅行参观了很多地方吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天聚餐的时候你不喝酒吗？","这次旅行参观了很多地方吧？","这么好的日子，怎么可能不喝酒呢？"],"answer":2}]}
